{"level":30,"time":1776457971209,"pid":85817,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":21,"prompt":"Identify and document all transformer pad locations on this electrical plan. For each transformer pad, please provide:\n1. Location description (which building, area of site, nearby features)\n2. Approximate dimensions if shown\n3. Any clearance dimensions or spacing notes shown on the plan\n4. Type of transformer service (single-phase or three-phase)\n5. Any protection features shown (bollards, barriers, etc.)\n6. Proximity to buildings, structures, parking areas, sidewalks, or other site features\n7. Any AE Design detail references or notes associated with the transformers\n\nAlso note any easements shown relative to the transformer locations.","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on the provided electrical plan, I have identified five transformer pads. Here is the detailed information for each, exactly as depicted on the plan:\n\n**1. Transformer Pad 1 (Northwest Area)**\n*   **Location description:** Located in the northwest corner of the site, northwest of Building 1, near the circular driveway/turnaround and a large existing tree.\n*   **Approximate dimensions:** Not dimensioned on the plan.\n*   **Clearance dimensions/spacing notes:** None shown.\n*   **Type of transformer service:** Not explicitly stated (single-phase or three-phase is not indicated).\n*   **Protection features:** None shown (no bollards or barriers indicated).\n*   **Proximity:** Very close to the curved curb of the driveway. It is adjacent to an \"Electrical Pull Box\".\n*   **AE Design detail references:** None referenced.\n*   **Easements:** It is located near, but appears just outside of, the \"Sidewalk Easement\" boundary shown along the western edge.\n\n**2. Transformer Pad 2 (West-Central Area)**\n*   **Location description:** Located on the western side of the site, situated between Valley View Road and Building 2.\n*   **Approximate dimensions:** Not dimensioned on the plan.\n*   **Clearance dimensions/spacing notes:** None shown.\n*   **Type of transformer service:** Not explicitly stated.\n*   **Protection features:** None shown.\n*   **Proximity:** West of Building 2 (specifically Unit 201). It is near an \"Electrical Pull Box\" and \"Electrical Meters\" serving Building 2.\n*   **AE Design detail references:** None referenced.\n*   **Easements:** It is located just east of the \"10' Sidewalk Easement\" that runs parallel to Valley View Road.\n\n**3. Transformer Pad 3 (East-Central Area)**\n*   **Location description:** Located in the eastern central portion of the site, between Building 4 and Building 5.\n*   **Approximate dimensions:** Not dimensioned on the plan.\n*   **Clearance dimensions/spacing notes:** None shown.\n*   **Type of transformer service:** Not explicitly stated.\n*   **Protection features:** None shown.\n*   **Proximity:** Directly east of Building 4 (specifically Unit 404) and west of Building 5. It connects via an underground line to a nearby \"Electrical Pull Box\".\n*   **AE Design detail references:** None referenced.\n*   **Easements:** It is located near a \"25' Drainage Easement\" boundary.\n\n**4. Transformer Pad 4 (Southwest Area)**\n*   **Location description:** Located on the western side of the site, south of Pad 2, situated between Valley View Road and Building 8.\n*   **Approximate dimensions:** Not dimensioned on the plan.\n*   **Clearance dimensions/spacing notes:** None shown.\n*   **Type of transformer service:** Not explicitly stated.\n*   **Protection features:** None shown.\n*   **Proximity:** West of Building 8 (specifically Unit 801). It is adjacent to an \"Electrical Pull Box\" and near \"Electrical Meters\" serving Building 8.\n*   **AE Design detail references:** None referenced.\n*   **Easements:** It is located just east of the \"10' Sidewalk Easement\" that runs parallel to Valley View Road.\n\n**5. Transformer Pad 5 (Southeast Area)**\n*   **Location description:** Located in the southeastern portion of the site, between Building 7 and Building 6.\n*   **Approximate dimensions:** Not dimensioned on the plan.\n*   **Clearance dimensions/spacing notes:** None shown.\n*   **Type of transformer service:** Not explicitly stated.\n*   **Protection features:** None shown.\n*   **Proximity:** East of Building 7 (specifically Unit 703) and west of Building 6 (specifically Unit 602). It is adjacent to an \"Electrical Pull Box\".\n*   **AE Design detail references:** None referenced.\n*   **Easements:** It is situated roughly north of the utility easements running along the southern property boundary, though not directly inside a labeled easement at its immediate location.\n\n**General Note on the Document:**\nAll five pads are labeled uniformly as **\"Electrical Transformer Pad\"**. Specific engineering details such as dimensions, clearance zones, service phasing (1P/3P), bollard protection, or specific Austin Energy (AE) detail callouts are **not provided** on this specific sheet (\"Preliminary Electrical Design Plan\").","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1444,"outputTokens":980,"totalTokens":4681,"reasoningTokens":2257},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2092056]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than guessing. Transcribe field labels and values exactly as written.\n\n