{"level":30,"time":1776458189642,"pid":85817,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011VELZ3DX61ebAYrhUxVJKt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"From Sheet 21 blocks, I can see:\n\n**Block 3** - The main drawing contains:\n- Transformers, pull boxes, UNDERGROUND electric lines, and electrical meters\n- NO mention of overhead electric lines\n\nSo Sheet 21 (Electrical Plan) shows ONLY underground electric infrastructure.\n\nBut Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan) guide explicitly mentions \"Utility lines (Water, Storm Drain, **Overhead Electric**)\" in the drawing.\n\nThis is interesting. The Landscape Plan shows overhead electric lines, but the Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) only shows underground utilities. This suggests the overhead electric lines are existing infrastructure on or near the property, not proposed by this project.\n\nLet me check the site plan (Sheet 9) to see if it shows overhead lines and utility poles.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2546,"cache_read_input_tokens":52445,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2546},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ebb5ab1e-5561-44cc-87a8-e1311e730c80","uuid":"3739e9fa-a107-48ff-b06c-fbb3aa472ed6"}
