{"level":30,"time":1776458362090,"pid":85817,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01X1937tfsdz642ygVRr4ebo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! Now I have a clearer picture. From the vision analysis:\n\n**Sheet 4 (Existing Conditions):**\n- There are **overhead utility lines (O.H.U.L.)** along the western and northern boundaries\n- **Utility poles** are located at:\n  - Southwest corner\n  - Midway along western boundary\n  - Northwest corner\n  - Northern property boundary\n- There is **one down guy wire** extending from the pole on the northern property boundary\n- **Electric easements** are noted:\n  - \"5' ELEC., TELE. & C.A.T.V. EASEMENT\" along northern boundary\n  - \"5' ELEC. EASEMENT\" along southern boundary\n\n**Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan):**\n- An overhead electric line (labeled \"-OHE-\") runs along the **southern boundary**\n- This line routes directly over:\n  - Landscaped areas\n  - Proposed trees (including mitigation trees and parking buffer trees)\n- **NO clearance dimensions are shown** on the landscape plan\n- The proposed trees appear to be very close to or directly under the overhead line\n\nThis is a critical finding. The landscape plan shows trees proposed near or under overhead electric lines, but NO clearance dimensions are provided. According to the grouping's regulatory overview:\n- Trees proposed within **10 lateral feet** of overhead distribution conductors must be from the \"Utility Compatible\" list (ECM Appendix F)\n- The checklist item EL-1.37 requires verification that trees near overhead lines are utility-compatible species\n\nLet me check the landscape blocks and tree list to see what species are proposed.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2513,"cache_read_input_tokens":49942,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2513},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f1a6fb5a-883d-4cd9-82be-985a56b0d602","uuid":"721a9ae8-28e8-4050-adc5-36fc42360b42"}
