{"level":30,"time":1776459690486,"pid":85817,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G5UfRpbkxX8e4uYBv4mrR2","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"site:library.municode.com Austin ECM Appendix F tree species chart\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Environmental Criteria Manual | Austin, TX - Municode Library\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual\"},{\"title\":\"APPENDIX F | Environmental Criteria Manual | Austin, TX\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual?nodeId=APXFDECATRSP\"},{\"title\":\"APPENDIX N - CITY OF AUSTIN PREFERRED PLANT LIST\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual?nodeId=APXNCIAUPRPLLI\"},{\"title\":\"SECTION 3 - TREE AND NATURAL AREA PRESERVATION\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual?nodeId=S3TRNAARPR_3.1.0GE\"},{\"title\":\"ECM APPENDIX W | Environmental Criteria Manual | Austin, TX\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual?nodeId=ECM_APPENDIX_WVEGRROPEST\"},{\"title\":\"APPENDIX K: - ARBORICULTURAL PRACTICES | Austin, TX\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual?nodeId=APXKARPRAR\"},{\"title\":\"SECTION 3 | Environmental Criteria Manual | Austin, TX\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual?nodeId=S3TRNAARPR\"},{\"title\":\"ITEM NO. 610S | Standard Specifications Manual | Austin, TX\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/standard_specifications_manual?nodeId=AUSTIN_TX_STANDARD_SPECIFICATIONS_TECHNICAL_MANUAL_SERIES_600ENEN_ITEM_NO._610SPRTROTVE12-7-18\"},{\"title\":\"1.6.0 | Environmental Criteria Manual | Austin, TX\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual?nodeId=S1WAQUMA_1.6.0DEGUWAQUCO\"},{\"title\":\"SECTION 2 - LANDSCAPE | Austin, TX - Municode Library\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual?nodeId=S2LA\"}]\n\nI found search results pointing to Appendix F in the Austin Environmental Criteria Manual on the Municode Library website. The second result appears to be directly for Appendix F, though the page content shown is limited. \n\nThe Appendix F page is available in the Environmental Criteria Manual on the Municode Library at this URL: https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual?nodeId=APXFDECATRSP\n\nTo view the full tree species chart in Appendix F, you would need to visit that direct link, as the search results don't display the detailed content of the chart itself.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MPBPYGjbZDsqxm3Nv5ubF2","session_id":"f9937603-308a-417f-be5d-ed14424eb758","uuid":"dee0b32a-17f2-401e-b0ea-c5ad272d467c"}
{"level":30,"time":1776459690486,"pid":85817,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VQ3DQUtUWYhj8dfZ9FRFcP","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"ECM 2.4.1\" OR \"ECM 2.4.2\" Austin utility compatible trees planting\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CITY OF AUSTIN – DEVELOPMENT SERVICES DEPARTMENT\",\"url\":\"https://zilkerneighborhood.org/dev/1209AzieMorton/1209AzieMorton-site_plan_MRC0_(2020-03-05).pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Significant Tree Identification\",\"url\":\"https://services.austintexas.gov/edims/document.cfm?id=375574\"},{\"title\":\"20241106-005: Austin Tree Regulation Presentation | Environmental Commission\",\"url\":\"https://bandc.crccheck.com/envboard/440150-20241106-005-austin-tree-regulation-presentation/\"},{\"title\":\"4.Backup_JSC_Presentation on Tree Regulations and Protections_241023 | Joint Sustainability Committee\",\"url\":\"https://bandc.crccheck.com/jsc/439629-4backup_jsc_presentation-on-tree-regulations-and-protections_241023/\"},{\"title\":\"Environmental Criteria Manual | Austin, TX - Municode Library\",\"url\":\"https://library.municode.com/tx/austin/codes/environmental_criteria_manual\"},{\"title\":\"§ 3.5.4. Mitigation Measures, Appendix 3.5.0. DESIGN CRITERIA, Section 3. TREE AND NATURAL AREA PRESERVATION, Environmental Criteria Manual, Austin\",\"url\":\"http://austin-tx.elaws.us/code/ecm_sects3_3.5.0_sec3.5.4\"},{\"title\":\"tree and natural area preservation 3.1.0 - AustinTexas.gov\",\"url\":\"https://services.austintexas.gov/edims/document.cfm?id=357827\"},{\"title\":\"§ 2.4.6. Irrigation of Landscape Areas, Appendix 2.4.0. BASIC REQUIREMENTS, Section 2. LANDSCAPE, Environmental Criteria Manual, Austin\",\"url\":\"http://austin-tx.elaws.us/code/ecm_sects2_2.4.0_sec2.4.6\"},{\"title\":\"Item No. 42 Late Backup 5/5/2016 Initiated by NHCD ORDINANCE NO.\",\"url\":\"https://services.austintexas.gov/edims/document.cfm?id=253572\"},{\"title\":\"20250602-002: Austin’s Heritage Tree Ordinance Presentation | Environmental Commission\",\"url\":\"https://bandc.crccheck.com/envboard/452773-20250602-002-austins-heritage-tree-ordinance-presentation/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about ECM 2.4.1 and ECM 2.4.2 related to utility-compatible trees in Austin:\n\nThe City's Environmental Criteria Manual (ECM) § 2.4.1.D and § 2.4.2.C state that \"In areas where utility lines are present or proposed only trees from the Utility Compatible Shade Trees list (see Appendix F) shall be planted within a) 10 lateral feet from any overhead distribution\" line.\n\nThis requirement is part of Austin's Environmental Criteria Manual and applies to landscape planting in areas where utility lines exist or are planned. The specific tree species that are considered utility-compatible can be found in Appendix F of the ECM, which contains the \"Descriptive Categories of Tree Species.\"\n\nThe key takeaway is that when planting trees near utility infrastructure in Austin, only trees from the approved Utility Compatible Shade Trees list may be used within the specified distance from utility lines.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MPBPYGjbZDsqxm3Nv5ubF2","session_id":"f9937603-308a-417f-be5d-ed14424eb758","uuid":"405397a8-dfdb-4553-a3cd-830eb8dcf5f9"}
{"level":30,"time":1776459690486,"pid":85817,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0171AYWBzs42gvqXH1jD9xGe","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"site:austin-tx.elaws.us ECM Appendix F tree species\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"§ 3.5.4. Mitigation Measures, Appendix 3.5.0. DESIGN CRITERIA, Section 3. TREE AND NATURAL AREA PRESERVATION, Environmental Criteria Manual, Austin\",\"url\":\"http://austin-tx.elaws.us/code/ecm_sects3_3.5.0_sec3.5.4\"},{\"title\":\"§ 3.3.2. General Tree Survey Standards, Appendix 3.3.0. TREE SURVEYS, Section 3. TREE AND NATURAL AREA PRESERVATION, Environmental Criteria Manual, Austin\",\"url\":\"http://austin-tx.elaws.us/code/ecm_sects3_3.3.0_sec3.3.2\"},{\"title\":\"§ 3.3.1. Survey Requirements by Jurisdiction, Appendix 3.3.0. TREE SURVEYS, Section 3. TREE AND NATURAL AREA PRESERVATION, Environmental Criteria Manual, Austin\",\"url\":\"http://austin-tx.elaws.us/code/ecm_sects3_3.3.0_sec3.3.1\"},{\"title\":\"§ 3.5.2. Tree Preservation Criteria, Appendix 3.5.0. DESIGN CRITERIA, Section 3. TREE AND NATURAL AREA PRESERVATION, Environmental Criteria Manual, Austin\",\"url\":\"http://www.austin-tx.elaws.us/code/ecm_sects3_3.5.0_sec3.5.2\"},{\"title\":\"§ 3.5.3. Design Constraints and Alternatives, Appendix 3.5.0. DESIGN CRITERIA, Section 3. TREE AND NATURAL AREA PRESERVATION, Environmental Criteria Manual, Austin\",\"url\":\"http://austin-tx.elaws.us/code/ecm_sects3_3.5.0_sec3.5.3\"},{\"title\":\"§ 1.3.5. Endangered Species, Appendix 1.3.0. ENVIRONMENTAL RESOURCE INVENTORY, Section 1. WATER QUALITY MANAGEMENT, Environmental Criteria Manual, Austin\",\"url\":\"http://austin-tx.elaws.us/code/ecm_sects1_1.3.0_sec1.3.5\"},{\"title\":\"Appendix P-2. CITY OF AUSTIN STANDARD NOTES FOR TREE AND NATURAL AREA PROTECTION, Environmental Criteria Manual, Austin\",\"url\":\"http://austin-tx.elaws.us/code/ecm_appp-2\"}]\n\nThe web search found several results related to ECM (Environmental Criteria Manual) sections and tree species references on the Austin, Texas eLaws website. The search results show references to Appendix F in the context of replacement tree species requirements.\n\nKey findings:\n\n75 percent of the total caliper inches of replacement trees required must be represented by significant shade trees located in Appendix F, with the remaining 25 percent of total caliper inches represented by a mixture of Appendix F tree species.\n\nAll trees selected must be suitable for the environment of the immediate planting site, with Appendix F providing specific categorization such as tree, soil, site, or regulatory qualities.\n\nThe search results also reference other appendices and sections of the ECM related to tree preservation and protection, but the actual complete list of tree species in Appendix F itself was not included in these search results. To access the full Appendix F tree species list, you would need to visit the direct link to that appendix on the austin-tx.elaws.us website.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MPBPYGjbZDsqxm3Nv5ubF2","session_id":"f9937603-308a-417f-be5d-ed14424eb758","uuid":"ae818cf1-c7b3-4c8a-b47a-66282bcf6f4e"}
