* of the tree trunk.\n4.  **Canopy Overlap**: The diagram shows that the mapped tree canopy **does not overlap or extend over** the proposed transformer location. The canopy boundary curves inward before reaching the transformer footprint.\n5.  **Tree Species**: There is **no tree species labeled** within the diagram or its corresponding \"CANOPY CALCULATIONS :\" section for Tree 4038H.\n6.  **Landscape Features Between**: There are **no prominent landscape features labeled directly between** the tree trunk/canopy and the proposed transformer. Contour lines (e.g., \"-681-\") pass through the area. A feature labeled \"**PROPOSED SIDEWALK**\" runs adjacent to the west/northwest edge of the transformer pad, but it is not positioned between the transformer and the tree.\n\n---\n\n### **Tree 4034 (Diagram 1, Bottom Right)**\n\n1.  **Transformer Location**: There is **no \"PROPOSED TRANSFORMER\" labeled or visually identifiable** within the \"1 CANOPY IMPACT TREE 4034\" diagram.\n2.  **Estimated Distance**: N/A (Transformer not found).\n3.  **Side of Tree**: N/A (Transformer not found).\n4.  **Canopy Overlap**: N/A (Transformer not found).\n5.  **Tree Species**: There is **no tree species labeled** in this diagram.\n6.  **Landscape Features**: N/A (Transformer not found).\n\n*(Note regarding document accuracy: The \"CANOPY CALCULATIONS :\" text block positioned above the Tree 4034 diagram contains a discrepancy, as it is incorrectly labeled for \"TREE 4038H\". Even within this text block, no species information is provided).*","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1473,"outputTokens":615,"totalTokens":5259,"reasoningTokens":3171},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2058368]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n