{"level":30,"time":1776460040637,"pid":85817,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01WGuHaKegKxYDxx8yTMG7UV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have gathered comprehensive research. Let me compile my findings by systematically evaluating each checklist item:\n\n## RESEARCH PHASE SUMMARY\n\n**Key Findings - What IS Present:**\n- 5 transformer pads identified on Electrical Plan (Sheet 21)\n- All pads located adjacent to vehicle circulation areas (parking, driveways)\n- Fire protection plan shows fire hydrant locations\n- Landscape plan shows vegetation layout\n- Grading plan shows general site drainage flowing away from buildings\n- Site plan shows buildings, parking, utilities in general\n\n**Critical Gaps - What IS NOT Present (NOT FOUND / COULD NOT VERIFY):**\n1. **NO clearance dimensions** between any transformer pad and buildings, structures, fences, utilities, sidewalks, fire hydrants, or trees\n2. **NO transformer specifications** - no kVA, voltage, single-phase/three-phase, or oil-filled/dry-type indicated\n3. **NO access door orientation** - no markings showing which side is the access door\n4. **NO bollard details** - despite all pads being adjacent to parking/vehicle areas\n5. **NO Austin Energy Design approval documents** - no ESPA, transformer pad details, or written approvals\n6. **NO transformer easements** - not shown on plat or documented\n7. **NO utility separation documentation** - no dimensions from water, wastewater, storm, or gas lines\n8. **NO tree species verification** - no ECM Appendix F utility-compatible species confirmed\n9. **NO root barrier details** - no specifications for trees within 20 feet\n10. **NO cross-section drawings** - no vertical clearance documentation\n11. **NO specific drainage analysis** - individual transformer pad drainage direction not documented\n12. **NO 100% private property confirmation** - electrical routing not fully documented on plans\n\n---\n\nNow let me evaluate each checklist item and provide my findings:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2109,"cache_read_input_tokens":64001,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2109},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6ac40e46-c33f-4252-a569-366ec49df9f2","uuid":"653dfac6-471c-4c6a-9c88-7e58407261c0"}
