t 21)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No transformer equipment specifications are provided indicating whether equipment is oil-filled or dry-type. No window, door, or ventilating duct locations on adjacent buildings are shown relative to transformer pads. No clearance dimensions (12-foot horizontal minimum) are documented. Compliance cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pads adjacent to sidewalks (Pads 1-3 per Sheet 21)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sidewalk locations are shown on Site Plan (Sheet 9) and Landscape Plan (Sheet 31). However, no clearance dimensions are provided between transformer pads and sidewalk back-of-curb locations. Minimum 2-foot clearance cannot be verified from available dimensions."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.9","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pads relative to fire exits and stairs (Sheet 21, Sheet 10)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No fire escape or external stair locations are shown on the Fire Protection Plan (Sheet 10) or site plan. No transformer equipment specifications indicate whether equipment is oil-filled (which triggers the 20-foot fire escape clearance requirement). The 20-foot horizontal/radial clearance from fire escapes cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicabl