-3 per Sheet 21)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sidewalk locations are shown on Site Plan (Sheet 9) and Landscape Plan (Sheet 31). However, no clearance dimensions are provided between transformer pads and sidewalk back-of-curb locations. Minimum 2-foot clearance cannot be verified from available dimensions."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.9","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pads relative to fire exits and stairs (Sheet 21, Sheet 10)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No fire escape or external stair locations are shown on the Fire Protection Plan (Sheet 10) or site plan. No transformer equipment specifications indicate whether equipment is oil-filled (which triggers the 20-foot fire escape clearance requirement). The 20-foot horizontal/radial clearance from fire escapes cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All five transformer pads (Sheet 21)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer access door orientation is not indicated on Electrical Plan. No hot-stick use area workspace is designated or dimensioned. Minimum 10-foot clearance from access door to open area or adjacent structures cannot be verified without access door orientation and clearance dimensions."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.11","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All five transformer pads if located in confined spaces (Sheet 21)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No cross-section drawings are provided analyzing whether transformer locations face confined spaces (niche, vault, or enclosed area on 3+ sides). No 15-foot clearance documentation is provided for any confined space scenarios. Compliance with 15-foot confined space clearance requirement cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.12","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations relative to fire hydrant near Buildings 6-7 (Sheet 10, Sheet 21)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fire Protection Plan (Sheet 10) shows one proposed fire hydrant located near Building 7. Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) shows transformer Pad 5 in the vicinity. No clearance dimension is provided between the fire hydrant and transformer pad locations. Minimum 5-foot clearance cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.13","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4","ECM Appendix F"],"applicableAreas":["Landscape plantings in proximity to transformer pads and overhead electric lines (Sheet 21, Sheet 31)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Landscape Plan (Sheet 31) shows trees and vegetation layout but provides only generic symbols (SY, PL, P, M) without specific tree species names. No reference to ECM Appendix F utility-compatible species list is provided. Trees within 10 lateral feet of transformer pads or within 15 lateral feet of overhead electric distribution cannot be verified as utility-compatible."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.14","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Shrubs and low vegetation adjacent to transformer pads (Sheet 21, Sheet 31)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Landscape Plan shows vegetation symbols but transformer access door orientation is not indicated. No clearance dimensions are provided between shrub plantings and transformer access door side (10 lateral feet required) or other sides (5 lateral feet required). Vegetation clearances cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.15","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Trees proposed within 20 lateral feet of transformer pad locations and underground electric equipment (Sheet 21, Sheet 31)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Landscape Plan shows tree locations but no root barrier details are shown or specified. No dimensions are provided showing which trees fall within 20 lateral feet of transformer pads or underground electric equipment. Required root barrier specifications (minimum 4 feet deep, 5 feet from equipment) cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.16","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations relative to trash/dumpster enclosures (Sheet 21, Sheet 9)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site Plan (Sheet 9) indicates trash collection is curbside with no centralized dumpster enclosure shown. However, speci