{"level":30,"time":1776460363118,"pid":85817,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01E7xj7uiGC6Ry1XBXuXAZn2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"EXCELLENT! The measurement tool confirmed:\n1. Tree canopy in southeast corner: 3.3 feet from OHE line (MEDIUM confidence)\n2. Tree cluster in southwest corner: 0 feet from OHE line - meaning the tree is AT or overlapping the OHE line itself (MEDIUM confidence)\n\nThis is a CLEAR VIOLATION of EL-1.37. Trees within 10 lateral feet of overhead distribution conductors must be utility-compatible species per ECM § 2.4.2.C and UCM § 1.10.10.4. The trees shown are within 0-3.3 feet of the overhead line, and there is NO notation on the landscape plan specifying that these trees are utility-compatible species.\n\nNow let me compile my final findings. Based on all my research:\n\n**FAIL ITEMS (deficiency IS present):**\n1. EL-1.7 - Building elevation sheets with surveyed conductor elevations not provided\n2. EL-1.8 - Section/plan views with clearance dimensions from conductor to building edges not provided\n3. EL-1.31 - Surveyor mid-span clearance data not provided\n4. EL-1.37 - Trees within 10 lateral feet of overhead distribution conductors without verification as utility-compatible species\n5. EL-1.46 - 48-hour notification note not included on plans\n\n**NOT-VERIFIABLE ITEMS (cannot determine compliance from available evidence):**\n1. EL-1.1 - Building horizontal sky-to-ground clearance cannot be verified (no surveyed conductor elevations or dimension lines provided)\n2. EL-1.2 - 15-foot radial clearance from distribution conductors cannot be verified (no clearance exhibits)\n3. EL-1.3 - Building projection clearances cannot be verified (no elevation details provided)\n4. EL-1.6 - Buildings in ROW clearance cannot be verified (no surveyed conductor data or section views)\n\n\n5. EL-1.18 - Driveway vertical clearances cannot be verified (no clearance dimensions or mid-span survey data)\n6. EL-1.23 - Cannot assess measurement methodology (no clearance dimensions shown)\n7. EL-1.43 - Transformer clearance cannot be verified (no surveyed conductor elevation or section views)\n\nNow I'll structure the final output with these findings.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2569,"cache_read_input_tokens":72002,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2569},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ebd3136-3d68-467e-99f2-1be8af4a9563","uuid":"21fcb36c-f7f2-4265-a63a-082cbc233f8f"}
